  is_active, is_featured, tags
) select
  'NDR High-Power Outdoor Trolley Speaker', 'NDR C8 High-Power Outdoor Trolley Speaker', 'ndr-high-power-outdoor-speaker', 'NDR High-Power Outdoor Trolley Speaker
 Professional PA Build: Heavy-duty wooden cabinet design with protective rubberized corner guards, front metal mesh grille, retractable telescoping handle, and smooth-rolling trolley wheels.
 Audio Performance: High-power outdoor PA sound system with deep bass response, dynamic EQ settings, and dedicated echo/treble/bass tuning controls.
 Microphone & PA Features: Supports wireless microphone connectivity (often includes dual wireless mics) with dedicated volume and priority controls for karaoke, events, and announcements.
 Connectivity & Modes: Bluetooth 5.0, FM Radio, USB flash drive playback, SD/TF card slot, 6.35mm wired microphone/guitar inputs, and AUX input.
 Battery: Built-in high-capacity rechargeable battery (12V) providing extended outdoor playback time.
Dimensions & Weight
 Height: 52 cm (approx. 85 cm – 90 cm with trolley handle extended)
 Width: 32 cm
 Depth/Thickness: 28 cm
 Weight: ~8.5 kg – 10.0 kg',
  (select id from public.brands where slug = 'ndr-c8'),
  (select id from public.categories where slug = 'speakers'),
  '/images/products/ndr-high-power-outdoor-speaker.jpg', '{}', 4,
  0, 4750, 0, 4800,
  1, 10, true, true, ARRAY['outdoor', 'trolley', 'wireless mic', 'high power', 'party', 'stand']::text[]
